{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃翠如與蕭正楠日前帶同兒子蕭哈哈一同飛赴馬來西亞度假，興奮迎接蕭哈哈的人生首次出埠旅遊！黃翠如事後於社交平台晒出一輯旅行美照，記錄一家三口溫馨滿瀉的日常。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6ccf8246-4da6-4eed-ba09-f23299469245.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20265cvHC4YDnr1789376624.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6ccf8246-4da6-4eed-ba09-f23299469245.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">封面照是黃翠如與蕭正楠抱著蕭哈哈在吉隆坡地標雙子塔前的合照，看得出他們非常甜蜜幸福，黃翠如更指這是她心中此次「百里挑一」的 Top 1 旅行紀念照。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"896bc9aa-1638-4312-b466-636421d0551f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026vhkfnbP29c1789376624.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"896bc9aa-1638-4312-b466-636421d0551f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">此行兩公婆寓吃喝玩樂於一身，除了探訪蕭哈哈的契爸、契媽、契哥外，也有趁機過一下難得的二人世界，玩得相當盡興。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T11:18:33.263522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}